=== OpenAPI adapter — design inspiration ===
The `mcptoon openapi` adapter (src/mcptoon/openapi.py) is an independent,
stdlib-only implementation. Its design conventions — operation naming from
operationId, path-item parameter inheritance, Optional[T] union collapsing,
and request-body content negotiation — follow the approach popularised by
knowsuchagency/mcp2cli (https://github.com/knowsuchagency/mcp2cli),
Copyright (c) 2026 Stephan Fitzpatrick, licensed under the MIT License.
No mcp2cli source code is included; this notice records the design lineage.
